# What people upload: audio to transcribe, markdown to turn into Docs. files/ is the store they now go to
# (files.py); uploads/ is the old folder, copied into it once. texts/ holds a document lent to a tool, for
# the length of one call (texts.py).
files/
texts/
uploads/

